# The Mog House Moogle's reply kinds: Give a Moogle a Break (100), The Moogle's Picnic! (101), Moogles in the Wild
# (102), AMK 1 A Moogle Kupo d'Etat (30023, Progress, with ENABLE_AMK 1, the mission current, level 10+ and the hidden
# moghouseExpo's notSeen 0; its finish completes the mission) and the Moogle's script (the menu). A Bastok char, fame
# 488 (level 7), the beds placed (GMs). Give available: 30005 (Progress) and AMK's 30023 (Progress): a tie: the
# mission's container first: 30023, finished: AMK 1 completed. Again: Give's 30005 alone (the menu is the script's, run
# on the quests' nil only). Give and Picnic completed (GMs), out and back: Wild's 30013 (Progress). The accepted replies
# (30006 / 30010 / 30014, Progress) are the main flows' (no rival once AMK 1 is done).
lists BastokMines/Moogle/onTrigger BastokMines/onEventFinish/30005 BastokMines/onEventFinish/30013
char zone=BastokMines pos=116.9,-1.6,-72 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
fame Bastok 488
setting ENABLE_AMK 1
mission Amk AMoogleKupoDetat current
charvar Quest[4][100]bedPlacedTime 1799999939
charvar Quest[4][102]bedPlacedTime 1799999939
login
zoneline BastokMines                    # into the Mog House
trigger Moogle                          # Give's 30005 and AMK's 30023 (Progress): a tie: the mission's container first: 30023
finish option=0                         # AMK 1 completed
trigger Moogle                          # Give's 30005 alone
finish option=0
quest OtherAreas.GiveAMoogleABreak completed # a GM
quest OtherAreas.TheMooglePicnic completed # a GM
warp -6,0,-50 BastokMarkets
warp 116.9,-1.6,-72 BastokMines
zoneline BastokMines
trigger Moogle                          # Wild's 30013
finish option=0
